{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[16,7,74,19],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99999,"text":"2006 年 8 月 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"3288ca9a-0af3-4ea3-956c-aeef03d3a8d7","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[17,20,74,31],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99998,"text":"第32卷 第8期 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"335968aa-3d7e-4286-81b2-d2cc24e0b75a","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[180,7,299,19],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99997,"text":"北 京 航 空 航 天 大 学 学 报 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"e3e28248-ea03-4168-94c1-3bd322758897","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[130,21,348,30],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99996,"text":"Journal of Beijing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"0674c741-03d3-4a3e-a11e-cb1837624e80","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[409,9,460,19],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99995,"text":"August 2006 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"88eb1a1b-672a-4523-a4e8-84398eeb6d4a","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[407,20,461,30],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99994,"text":"Vol. 32 No郾 8 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"a415b2b6-674b-43c4-b8da-e138453201ed","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[60,53,418,76],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":6,"text":"# 威布尔分布的极大似然估计的精度分析","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"3c5445b1-9c8a-45df-b8b8-79d5c7c8022d","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[147,88,330,104],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"text":"李 进 黄 敏 赵 宇 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"6d7aba37-2221-461c-92f0-a5ff51278a45","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[147,113,330,124],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"text":"北京航空航天大学 工程系统工程系 北京 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"a333cee5-42c3-4b4c-83ec-f6ea243b316c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-8"},{"bbox":[27,135,450,228],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"text":"摘 要: 威布尔分布参数估计的极大似然方法是一种常用的方法,在故障数不小于 的情况下推荐使用 但在工程中,由于产品的可靠性高,或者是样本量少,试验的故障数常 常是小于10,在这种情况下需要明确所得的评估结果的精度是否满足要求. 运用区间估计的 思想,提出了一种解决上述问题的评价和判断的方法,并应用此方法对完全样本情况下,形状 参数的极大似然估计量的精度进行了讨论 工程上,可以依据文中提供的结论定量分析威布尔 分布形状参数极大似然估计量的精度 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"c5b2b776-99c6-4bbb-917e-15e43f6f8019","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-9"},{"bbox":[48,229,265,243],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":10,"text":"关 键 词: 威布尔分布; 极大似然估计; 分析 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"7721cd59-f493-454e-993b-cadeffc71753","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-10"},{"bbox":[48,245,154,258],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"text":"中图分类号 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"0de278ca-29a3-4d72-8341-6bad16efc3f7","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-11"},{"bbox":[48,261,348,274],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"text":"文献标识码: A 文 章 编 号: 1001鄄5965(2006)08鄄0930鄄03 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"e184aa3a-918c-4e7c-acd8-31dbdd9032de","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-12"},{"bbox":[69,308,409,343],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":13,"text":"# Analysis of precision for maximum likelihood estimation in the Weibull distribution","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"5ddb4df2-049a-4b54-b154-341747648b90","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-13"},{"bbox":[171,350,306,363],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"text":"Li Jin Huang Min ZhaoYu ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"bbcb39bd-0745-4507-ad5c-63e72a018eb4","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-14"},{"bbox":[23,368,454,379],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"text":"( Dept. of System Engineering of Engineering Technology, Beijing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics, Beijing 100083, China) ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"256cebd6-8ee1-4933-beae-81acf91fcaab","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-15"},{"bbox":[6,381,471,520],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"text":"Abstract: Maximum likelihood estimation(MLE) in the Weibull distribution of parameters is considered an effective method, which is recommended in the case that the number of failure is more than 10 or equal 10. In practice, the number of failure is often less than 10 because of the high reliability or the fewness of sample. It is wanted to be known whether the MLE can be used in the case above; the number of failure, which makes the estimator have a given precision, will be known, sometimes, before the experimentation applying. So a method of analysis and estimation, which resolves that problems, was given with the idea of interval estima鄄 tion. Then the precision of the estimator of shape parameter was discussed by this way under complete sample. In the practice projects, the precision of maximum likelihood estimation of Weibull shape parameter is quanti鄄 tatively provided by the conclusion. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"2ee8171f-6f06-4e92-91dd-47901a693d4c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-16"},{"bbox":[27,523,350,536],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"text":"Key words: Weibull distribution; maximum likelihood estimation; analysis ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"1090d9b1-881b-45d7-a2a3-5f45e29695d8","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-17"},{"bbox":[6,583,99,599],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":18,"text":"# 1 问题的提出","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"161b644e-2f8c-47f5-a20f-cc28dbdda17c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-18"},{"bbox":[6,611,231,720],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":19,"text":"威布尔分布是一种常用的寿命分布 极大似 然估计法( MLE, Maximum Likelihood Estimation) 是一种对威布尔分布参数估计普遍采用的方法 一般在 $n \\geqslant r \\geqslant 1 0 ( \\ n$ $n$ 为样本量 $r$ 为失效数 的情 况下推荐使用. 但是在许多的工程领域中 由于产 品的可靠性比较高 或者样本量比较少 要达到故 障数大于或等于 这样的条件是比较困难的. 因 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"9651ca75-d03f-4e56-88c7-1162d87a6ad2","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-19"},{"bbox":[247,569,471,613],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":20,"text":"此 工程中常常在 $r \\leqslant 1 0$ 情况下 使用极大似然估 计. 在通常情况下 不清楚估计出参数的精度 也 同样不清楚估计出的参数是否满足要求. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"be17bfe5-80ac-498e-8209-98493b943bc8","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-20"},{"bbox":[247,615,471,723],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":21,"text":"实际上 无论是故障数大于或者小于 参 数的估计值都不能肯定等于参数的真实值 通常 的做法是进行区间估计 这样在给定置信度的情 况下 就可以得到置信区间. 但是 要是想要了解 估计出的参数在给定真值区间的概率 或者在试 验还没有进行时想要了解使参数的估计值具有一 定的精度的条件下所需要进行的试验的故障数 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"03fdf045-281a-4601-b064-f6dda3c7f426","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-21"},{"bbox":[14,733,93,743],"type":"footer","angle":0,"index":1000021,"text":"收稿日期 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"c2dbae3c-59dd-4f75-937f-5dbf100cf9cc","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-22"},{"bbox":[14,745,247,756],"type":"footer","angle":0,"index":1000022,"text":"作者简介: 李 进(1980-), 男, 北京人,硕士生, jinlee@ sohu. com. ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"8b346654-e8ee-4c94-ad46-c20e51fe572c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"0-23"}],[{"bbox":[17,18,46,29],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99999,"text":"第 8 期 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"3552976b-5874-4922-8915-50a42a437284","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[143,18,339,30],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99998,"text":"李 进等 威布尔分布的极大似然估计的精度分析 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"a97bef32-5f84-42bb-bb0c-35ad5994625c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[7,36,169,49],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"text":"区间估计显然不能解决这样的问题. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"13035498-2370-4b5c-9985-1b866dbd07e3","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[6,52,230,128],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"text":"本文为解决此类的问题 提出一种方法. 同时 使用此方法对于完全样本的情况下 威布尔分布 的形状参数 $\\beta$ 的极大似然估计量 $\\hat { \\boldsymbol { \\beta } }$ 进行了估计 精度的讨论 同时得到了满足相应条件的最小样 本失效数. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"44d5ea9a-e4ef-4504-92b9-9c9c795aeaec","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[6,143,198,159],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"text":"# 2 极大似然估计量的评价方法","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"cee7b77e-f08b-4ea3-8b20-0e7836e3079d","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[27,167,183,180],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"text":"两参数威布尔分布,其密度函数为 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"4196c458-777d-4c05-9ff0-7e1c493851d4","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[16,183,228,229],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":7,"text":"$$\nf (t) = \\frac {\\beta}{\\alpha} \\left(\\frac {t}{\\alpha}\\right) ^ {\\beta - 1} \\exp \\left[ - \\left(\\frac {t}{\\alpha}\\right) ^ {\\beta} \\right] \\quad t \\geqslant 0 \\tag {1}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2172bf2f-a805-4356-963f-4b31b0bac516","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[7,231,229,259],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"text":"其中 $\\beta { > } 0$ 和 $\\alpha { > } 0$ 是参数,分别称为威布尔分布的 形状参数和尺度参数. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"49a556a8-a1ab-44c0-8fbc-c3f547c23d22","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-7"},{"bbox":[7,261,230,292],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"text":"对于威布尔分布的两个参数的极大似然估计 量是由下面的方程组解出的[1]. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"5fff297f-4544-4ec5-8726-75c004fde3b5","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-8"},{"bbox":[46,296,228,435],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":10,"text":"$$\n\\left. \\begin{array}{l} \\frac {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {r} t _ {i} ^ {\\beta} \\ln t _ {i} + (n - r) \\cdot t _ {\\mathrm {Z}} ^ {\\beta} \\ln t _ {\\mathrm {Z}}}{\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {r} t _ {i} ^ {\\beta} + (n - r) \\cdot t _ {\\mathrm {Z}} ^ {\\beta}} - \\\\ \\frac {1}{r} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {r} \\ln t _ {i} - \\frac {1}{\\beta} = 0 \\\\ \\alpha = \\left(\\frac {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {r} t _ {i} ^ {\\beta} + (n - r) \\cdot t _ {\\mathrm {Z}} ^ {\\beta}}{r}\\right) ^ {\\frac {1}{\\beta}} \\end{array} \\right\\} \\tag {2}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"6ecf8eaf-3f42-4ffd-bdc5-2124c9d4ef4e","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-9"},{"bbox":[7,437,197,451],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"text":"其中, $\\mathbf { \\nabla } _ { t _ { i } }$ 为第 $i$ 个失效时间; $t _ { Z }$ 为截尾时间. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"1791ba8f-aae1-488a-b184-7a22c4986db2","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-10"},{"bbox":[6,453,230,657],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"text":"对于方程 解出的极大似然的估计值 $\\hat { \\boldsymbol { \\beta } }$ 和 $\\hat { \\alpha }$ 理论上符合某种分布. 下面就以 $\\beta$ 为例来说明 这个方法. 首先,构造枢轴量: $Z = { \\hat { \\boldsymbol { \\beta } } } / \\beta$ (证明见文 献 所以 $Z$ 的分布和 $\\beta$ 的取值是无关的. 这 样 就可以得到 $Z$ 的分布 $F _ { Z }$ 得到 $Z$ 的分布 $F _ { Z }$ 的 方法有很多 例如用公式推导或是用模拟的方 法 . 然后 利用这个分布 计算概率 $p$ . 计算的步 骤是: $\\textcircled{1}$ 取 区 间 $\\left[ z _ { 1 } , z _ { 2 } \\right]$ ; $\\textcircled{2}$ 计 算 $p = F _ { z } ( z _ { 2 } ) -$ $F _ { z } ( z _ { 1 } )$ . 这样 得到的概率 $p$ 可以描述为 在给定 $n$ 和 $r$ 的情况下 $\\hat { \\beta }$ 在真值 $\\beta$ 的区间 $\\left[ z _ { 1 } \\beta , z _ { 2 } \\beta \\right]$ 的概 率为 $p$ . 由于 $Z$ 为枢轴量 所以这个概率 $p$ 只与 $n$ 和 $r$ 有关. 这样,就可以用这个概率 $p$ 来评价和判 断 $n$ 和 $r$ 在各种情况下 $\\hat { \\beta }$ 的优劣了. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"89063bff-df1d-4941-bb93-f3fa67e7a694","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-11"},{"bbox":[6,671,223,687],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":13,"text":"# 3 完全样本情况下的 MLE 的评价","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"1473e6c1-59c1-4474-bf61-faef33296352","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-12"},{"bbox":[7,695,230,725],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"text":"下面就利用上面的方法对完全样本情况下的 威布尔分布形状参数的 $\\hat { \\beta }$ 进行评价. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"257a0055-1588-4290-8b28-0e18bac66feb","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-13"},{"bbox":[7,727,169,741],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":15,"text":"# 3. 1 枢轴量 $\\scriptstyle { Z = { \\hat { \\pmb { \\beta } } } / \\pmb { \\beta } }$ 的分布的研究","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"28844108-b5f5-4a56-a171-175572dcebff","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-14"},{"bbox":[28,743,230,756],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"text":"极值分布是与威布尔分布等价的 可以代替 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2fb9be25-30aa-47bc-94e3-83754392315c","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-15"},{"bbox":[247,36,434,49],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"text":"其的一种更为方便的形式 其密度函数为 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"9b6f6011-756d-4ef8-9f8e-9b5f5e78d67e","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-16"},{"bbox":[330,52,385,66],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":18,"text":"$$\nf (x, u, b) =\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"6d6ca7dd-16ec-49ca-871e-602e52ab5562","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-17"},{"bbox":[260,69,468,110],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":19,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\frac {1}{b} \\exp [ (x - u) / b ] \\exp \\{- \\exp [ (x - u) / b ] \\} \\\\ - \\infty <   x <   \\infty \\tag {3} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"336e505b-fe7d-43fd-9417-009eea935fdd","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-18"},{"bbox":[247,112,470,157],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":20,"text":"其中 $u ( - \\infty < u < \\infty$ 和 $b ( \\ b { > } 0 )$ 是参数. 若 $T$ 服从 威布尔分布,则随机变量 $X { = } \\log T$ 就服从极值分 布,其中 $u = \\log \\alpha , b = \\beta ^ { - 1 }$ . ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"946549f9-abb9-4577-91e0-e9675b9c8962","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-19"},{"bbox":[247,163,470,255],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":21,"text":"对于极值分布函数的参数 $b , Z ^ { \\prime } = \\hat { b } / b$ 同样为 枢轴量. 对于 $Z ^ { \\prime }$ 的分布 已经给出 了其分布密度 但是同时也指出对于 $Z ^ { \\prime }$ 忆的分布密 度的积分不可能有解析的表达式. 所以只能找出 一个近似的分布 对于 $Z ^ { \\prime }$ 的分布 从经验中发展 起来有如下形式的近似 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"c9d97376-2d86-43a0-b314-6833ab9b9d7a","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-20"},{"bbox":[333,258,469,273],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":22,"text":"$$\ng Z ^ {\\prime} \\sim \\chi_ {(h)} ^ {2} \\tag {4}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"b07c3eda-90be-4549-8c7a-2e63a0ef10ba","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-21"},{"bbox":[247,274,470,350],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":23,"text":"其中 $^ { g }$ 和 $h$ 只与 $n$ 和 $r$ 有 关. Harter 和 Moore (1968),McCool(1975)和 Lawless 和 Mann(1976) 分别得到结果组成了表 给出了各种 $( r , n )$ 组合 的 $h$ 的值, $^ { g }$ 由 $\\scriptstyle g = h + 2$ 给出. 表 1 只列出了对于 本文有用的值[2]. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"009d1c16-97f0-4853-9c35-bd62d1f92baa","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-22"},{"bbox":[313,353,405,365],"index":24,"angle":0,"type":"table_caption","text":"表1 近似所用的 $\\pmb { h }$ 值","id":"705bc6f2-c198-40bb-836f-2db780dcb38d","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-23"},{"bbox":[251,367,469,419],"index":25,"angle":0,"type":"table_body","img_path":"/","id":"f4cf6f2b-15b3-46c3-a734-3f4fcc3c2bd5","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"table_body":"<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">r/n</td><td colspan=\"5\">n</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>40</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>1.0</td><td>12.9</td><td>29.3</td><td>62.4</td><td>128.2</td><td>194.8</td></tr></table>","page_idx":1,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-24"},{"bbox":[247,422,470,465],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":26,"text":"对于表 中没有给出的 $h$ 值 可以通过线性 插值获得 本段论述的各种近似和取值以及具体 的证明和解释见文献 . ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"a3238090-2213-40c7-a8c3-6ccb7ee139dd","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-25"},{"bbox":[268,468,449,482],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":27,"text":"这样就可以得到 $F _ { Z }$ 的近似的计算公式: ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"8e35092f-3945-4f30-8e1e-c2ac25433f1f","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-26"},{"bbox":[272,487,469,537],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":28,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} F _ {Z} (x) = P (Z \\leqslant x) = P \\left(\\chi_ {(h)} ^ {2} \\geqslant \\frac {g}{x}\\right) = \\\\ 1 - P \\left(\\chi_ {(h)} ^ {2} \\leqslant \\frac {g}{x}\\right) \\tag {5} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"881d0d24-2dca-4fd6-b0f1-03f4e0206e97","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-27"},{"bbox":[268,541,385,553],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":29,"text":"式 是非常便于计算的. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"c077b18f-048a-49bc-9963-b3fe9ecefcbf","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-28"},{"bbox":[247,557,391,569],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":30,"text":"# 3. 2 对于 $r$ 的各种情况的计算","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"f761cabe-d03a-438f-a50e-03ccde1dcafe","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-29"},{"bbox":[247,572,470,633],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":31,"text":"关于下面的讨论 假定讨论的 $r$ 的范围是 . 这是由于 对于 $r { < } 3$ 的情况 认为不适合 用极大似然法进行估计 同时 对于 $r { > } 4 0$ 的情况 视为其估计的精度已经足够精确. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"0f96f486-9c39-4f59-bbda-6758e083be84","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-30"},{"bbox":[247,636,469,680],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":32,"text":"利用第 节中所给的方法 同时结合第 . 节中所推倒出的 $F _ { Z }$ 就可以很容易地求出概率 $p$ . 具体的计算步骤如下 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2b70ac6a-fb34-46d9-bd5e-70335ded652b","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"1-31"},{"bbox":[269,684,350,697],"type":"t