d":"d18d2641-b4f6-493e-b285-df35119d361f","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-2"},{"bbox":[10,96,231,147],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"text":"5) 则 $p = F _ { _ { Z } } \\left( z _ { 2 } \\right) - F _ { _ { Z } } \\left( z _ { 1 } \\right) = P \\ \\left( \\chi _ { _ { ( h ) } } ^ { 2 } \\leqslant \\frac { g } { z _ { 1 } } \\ \\right) - P$ $\\Big ( \\chi _ { ( h ) } ^ { 2 } \\leqslant \\frac { g } { z _ { 2 } } \\Big ) .$ z . ","id":"12958a77-4e26-438b-9955-828bcfd51658","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-3"},{"bbox":[6,149,230,207],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"text":"为了工程应用的方便 在构造表 的过程中 给定 $p = p _ { 0 }$ ,然后对于 $Z = \\frac { \\hat { \\beta } } { \\beta }$ 不同的区间,求出满足 $p ( r ) \\geqslant p _ { 0 }$ 最小的 $r$ 值. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"f31d48c4-0101-4c01-bc4c-5f33d5713caa","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-4"},{"bbox":[65,209,172,221],"index":7,"angle":0,"type":"table_caption","text":"表2 满足条件最小 $r$ 值表","id":"0907552f-fe46-462f-89d3-6d193665c75f","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-5"},{"bbox":[11,223,228,366],"index":8,"angle":0,"type":"table_body","img_path":"/","id":"9e168f20-88e8-4fb4-b3de-d9dab3cc34aa","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"table_body":"<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Z</td><td colspan=\"5\">p/%</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>60</td><td>70</td><td>80</td><td>90</td></tr><tr><td>[0.85,1.15]</td><td>15</td><td>22</td><td>32</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>[0.8,1.2]</td><td>9</td><td>13</td><td>19</td><td>29</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>[0.75,1.25]</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>14</td><td>20</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>[0.7,1.3]</td><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>15</td><td>24</td></tr><tr><td>[0.6,1.4]</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>[0.5,1.5]</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>8</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>[0.4,1.6]</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>[0.3,1.7]</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>[0.2,1.8]</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>7</td></tr></table>","page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-6"},{"bbox":[7,367,231,404],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"text":"注 $\\textcircled{1}$ 表中 代表 $r$ 的值大于 $\\textcircled{2}$ 由于 $r$ 的值最小为 所 以表的左下方都是 $\\textcircled{3}$ 对于表中没有给出的数据 用二次插值 可以近似地得到. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"b3d9a234-6163-443f-950e-e1e3d4bd358a","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-7"},{"bbox":[6,407,230,514],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":10,"text":"表 中数据的解释和使用的方法 以第 行 中的数 为例 代表故障数为 的完全样本 情况下 $\\hat { \\beta }$ 在真值区间 $[ 0 . \\ 8 \\beta , 1 . \\ 2 \\beta ]$ 内的概率为 $60 \\%$ . 这样在工程中 如果给出形状参数的估计值 可以接受的区间 同时给出可以接受的概率 就可 以得到要进行的试验在完全样本情况下最少的故 障数. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"4a56e073-4294-4139-9c28-3ae86fcb9ec8","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-8"},{"bbox":[7,517,230,546],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"text":"这里还要说明的一点就是这种评价的方法和 区间估计的区别 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"c4e64803-24e7-4436-8841-4d2f723fddc7","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-9"},{"bbox":[6,549,230,640],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"text":"这里只是一种评价和判断的方法 得到的 结论只是可以用和不可以用 可以不用知道参数 $\\beta$ 的真值 所以这里考虑的是估计的参数在真值 区间的概率 而区间估计所要求的是区间的数值 所以求的是在一定概率下的真值在估计参数的区 间; ","id":"4628ebf1-1554-4b63-a888-8edfc346b9f9","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-10"},{"bbox":[7,643,230,671],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"text":"这里所用的方法是给定区间求概率 而区 间估计是给定概率求区间. ","id":"e5e80139-33bc-4df1-ac4e-dd259615554c","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-11"},{"bbox":[27,674,230,687],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"text":"所以,本文的方法和区间估计可以说是一种 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"4936d5f3-cdb8-4718-908f-aab4b80362d2","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-12"},{"bbox":[248,36,410,49],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"text":"理念的两种不同角度的理解和看法. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"cdb69a01-40b9-4c9d-a99c-65e0c41a142e","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-13"},{"bbox":[246,64,327,79],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":17,"text":"# 4 结 束 语","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"591702a3-0bf3-47b6-8ffa-b90c3b4cbee6","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-14"},{"bbox":[246,88,470,196],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":18,"text":"本文对于威布尔分布的极大似然法的估计 量 在样本量和故障数的各种不同情况的精度 给 了一种评价和判断的方法. 同时对于完全样本情 况下 形状参数的极大似然估计进行了讨论 文中 并没有给出好坏的结论. 这是由于在不同的情况 下 要求的精度是不同的 所以可以根据不同的情 况 依照表 进行选择. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"033c5142-a20c-4940-84f7-292b7eb865b6","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-15"},{"bbox":[246,199,470,274],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":19,"text":"表2 中的数据定量地给出了满足一定精度要 求的威布尔分布形状参数的极大似然估计值所要 求的最少样本量 同时使得在工程中应用极大似 然估计威布尔形状参数时对估计值精度有了定量 的了解. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"62a7b12a-ab79-49a9-8f40-fb2c01b6fde6","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-16"},{"bbox":[247,278,470,322],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":20,"text":"对于文中没有讨论的尺度参数和不是完全样 本的情况 同样可以按照第 节中所述的方法 根 据不同的性质 分别进行分析和处理. ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"09670359-0c54-480e-9990-e19013ca5571","page_size":[480,766],"block_position":"2-17